tactBody":{"text":"Professional channels and resumes."},"copy-contactLinkedinLabel":{"text":"LinkedIn"},"copy-contactGithubLabel":{"text":"GitHub"},"copy-contactEmailLabel":{"text":"Email"},"copy-contactPhoneLabel":{"text":"Phone"},"copy-contactCurriculumPtLabel":{"text":"Resume in Portuguese"},"copy-contactCurriculumEnLabel":{"text":"Resume in English"},"copy-contactCurriculumDownloadLabel":{"text":"Download resume"},"copy-languageLabel":{"text":"Language"},"copy-resultsTitle":{"text":"Professional results"},"copy-resultsTimeReductionLabel":{"text":"Time reduction"},"copy-resultsTimeReduction":{"text":"Onboarding reduced from days to hours; 30% reduction in task completion time."},"copy-resultsStepsReductionLabel":{"text":"Step reduction"},"copy-resultsStepsReduction":{"text":"Manual steps reduced from 8–10 to 3–5."},"copy-resultsUsersServedLabel":{"text":"Users served"},"copy-resultsUsersServed":{"text":"Platform used by more than 2,000 monthly users."},"copy-resultsProductivityGainLabel":{"text":"Productivity gains"},"copy-resultsProductivityGain":{"text":"Approximately 50% reduction in JSON mapping effort; 25% reduction in form change requests."},"copy-projectsTitle":{"text":"Projects"},"copy-professionalProjectsTitle":{"text":"Professional projects"},"copy-personalProjectsTitle":{"text":"Personal projects"},"copy-projectDescriptionLabel":{"text":"Description"},"copy-projectContextLabel":{"text":"Context"},"copy-projectRoleLabel":{"text":"Role"},"copy-projectTechnicalDecisionsLabel":{"text":"Technical decisions"},"copy-projectTechnologiesLabel":{"text":"Technologies"},"copy-projectResultsLabel":{"text":"Results"},"copy-projectLearningsLabel":{"text":"Learnings"},"copy-projectLinksLabel":{"text":"Related links"},"baa8ec1d-f72e-482b-9d59-b4482ada0d32":{"title":"Junior Software Engineer","context":"Worked on a critical corporate application for a large company undergoing the digital transformation of its producer registration process. The project replaced an SAP-based workflow with a modern web application focused on speeding up onboarding, improving operational efficiency, and supporting thousands of users per month. The work was carried out within a multidisciplinary team responsible for architecture, integrations, and end-to-end product delivery."},"baa8ec1d-f72e-482b-9d59-b4482ada0d32-responsibilities-1":{"text":"Developing the corporate producer registration application."},"baa8ec1d-f72e-482b-9d59-b4482ada0d32-responsibilities-2":{"text":"Defining the application architecture and shared modules."},"baa8ec1d-f72e-482b-9d59-b4482ada0d32-responsibilities-3":{"text":"Developing integrations and reusable Java components."},"baa8ec1d-f72e-482b-9d59-b4482ada0d32-responsibilities-4":{"text":"Collaborating with a multidisciplinary team of five developers."},"baa8ec1d-f72e-482b-9d59-b4482ada0d32-technicalDecisions-1":{"text":"Migrating the legacy SAP-based registration workflow to a new corporate application."},"baa8ec1d-f72e-482b-9d59-b4482ada0d32-technicalDecisions-2":{"text":"Choosing REST API integration instead of tighter direct coupling."},"baa8ec1d-f72e-482b-9d59-b4482ada0d32-technicalDecisions-3":{"text":"Building a reusable Java JSON deserialization component."},"baa8ec1d-f72e-482b-9d59-b4482ada0d32-results-1":{"text":"Reduced onboarding steps from 8–10 to 3–5."},"baa8ec1d-f72e-482b-9d59-b4482ada0d32-results-2":{"text":"Reduced onboarding time from days to hours."},"baa8ec1d-f72e-482b-9d59-b4482ada0d32-results-3":{"text":"Platform used by more than 2,000 monthly users."},"baa8ec1d-f72e-482b-9d59-b4482ada0d32-results-4":{"text":"Reduced JSON mapping effort by approximately 50%."},"baa8ec1d-f72e-482b-9d59-b4482ada0d32-results-5":{"text":"Improved consistency and maintainability for the development team."},"9d9b5731-d559-46d4-9341-bad674266a49":{"title":"Software Developer","context":"Worked at a company focused on corporate digitalization, providing technical support in close collaboration with software engineering teams. Participated in the modernization of internal applications and digital transformation initiatives, contributing to operational efficiency and supporting the transition from technical support to software engineering."},"9d9b5731-d559-46d4-9341-bad674266a49-responsibilities-1":{"text":"Providing technical support in close collaboration with engineering teams."},"9d9b5731-d559-46d4-9341-bad674266a49-responsibilities-2":{"text":"Modernizing internal applications."},"9d9b5731-d559-46d4-9341-bad674266a49-responsibilities-3":{"text":"Implementing dynamic forms."},"9d9b5731-d559-46d4-9341-bad674266a49-responsibilities-4":{"text":"Modernizing legacy pages with React."},"9d9b5731-d559-46d4-9341-bad674266a49-technicalDecisions-1":{"text":"Replacing one-off fixes in static forms with dynamic forms."},"9d9b5731-d559-46d4-9341-bad674266a49-technicalDecisions-2":{"text":"Replacing legacy HTML/CSS/JavaScript pages with a React interface."},"9d9b5731-d559-46d4-9341-bad674266a49-results-1":{"text":"Reduced form change requests by 25%."},"9d9b5731-d559-46d4-9341-bad674266a49-results-2":{"text":"Enabled faster feature updates."},"9d9b5731-d559-46d4-9341-bad674266a49-results-3":{"text":"Reduced task completion time by 30%."},"3c67f7d3-57a6-4ece-af10-496b8ca33727":{"name":"DocFlow","description":"Backend for registering and tracking documents, with metadata in PostgreSQL and binary content in MinIO object storage. An evolving project; the frontend has not yet been implemented.","problemContext":"Separate file storage from metadata and track document lifecycles while handling failures between the database and object storage without assuming a distributed transaction.","solution":"A Java and Spring Boot REST API for registering and retrieving documents, with explicit processing states and a provider-independent storage interface.","role":"Development of a personal project focused on the backend and on documenting architectural decisions through specs and ADRs."},"3c67f7d3-57a6-4ece-af10-496b8ca33727-technicalDecisions-1":{"text":"Separation of domain, service, REST API and persistence responsibilities."},"3c67f7d3-57a6-4ece-af10-496b8ca33727-technicalDecisions-2":{"text":"A DocumentStorage interface with a MinIO adapter to isolate the storage integration."},"3c67f7d3-57a6-4ece-af10-496b8ca33727-technicalDecisions-3":{"text":"PENDING, PROCESSING, COMPLETED and FAILED states with domain-controlled transitions."},"3c67f7d3-57a6-4ece-af10-496b8ca33727-technicalDecisions-4":{"text":"Flyway database migrations and explicit handling of inconclusive storage results."},"3c67f7d3-57a6-4ece-af10-496b8ca33727-results-1":{"text":"Document registration and retrieval through a REST API, as documented in the repository."},"3c67f7d3-57a6-4ece-af10-496b8ca33727-results-2":{"text":"Document lifecycle and binary storage implemented, with documented unit and integration tests."},"3c67f7d3-57a6-4ece-af10-496b8ca33727-results-3":{"text":"Local PostgreSQL and MinIO infrastructure configured with Docker Compose."},"3c67f7d3-57a6-4ece-af10-496b8ca33727-learnings-1":{"text":"Modeling domain invariants and state transitions."},"3c67f7d3-57a6-4ece-af10-496b8ca33727-learnings-2":{"text":"Handling consistency and failures across PostgreSQL and object storage."},"3c67f7d3-57a6-4ece-af10-496b8ca33727-learnings-3":{"text":"Applying integration tests with Testcontainers and spec-driven development."},"3c67f7d3-57a6-4ece-af10-496b8ca33727-link-1":{"label":"GitHub"},"d9580705-9f05-407a-a367-1c729da2e63a":{"name":"Gestão Pro","description":"A financial and operational management web application that brings together products, suppliers, income, expenses and installments, with administrator and client workspaces.","problemContext":"Small businesses managing financial and operational information in spreadsheets need a structured way to connect records, transactions, due dates and historical data.","solution":"A React interface integrated with Firebase, providing product and supplier management, a chart of accounts, installment generation, accounts payable and receivable, historical records and CSV exports.","role":"Development of a personal project integrating the web interface, Firebase services and financial and operational business rules."},"d9580705-9f05-407a-a367-1c729da2e63a-technicalDecisions-1":{"text":"React with Vite, reusable components, contexts and hooks to organize the interface."},"d9580705-9f05-407a-a367-1c729da2e63a-technicalDecisions-2":{"text":"Firebase Authentication for sign-in and Firestore for data persistence."},"d9580705-9f05-407a-a367-1c729da2e63a-technicalDecisions-3":{"text":"A userId-based data model and access rules to separate clients and support an administrative view."},"d9580705-9f05-407a-a367-1c729da2e63a-technicalDecisions-4":{"text":"Installments linked to transactions as the foundation for accounts payable and receivable, with due-date-based statuses."},"d9580705-9f05-407a-a367-1c729da2e63a-technicalDecisions-5":{"text":"Native Firebase Auth password reset links and Functions for client administration."},"d9580705-9f05-407a-a367-1c729da2e63a-results-1":{"text":"Product records, income, expenses and due dates consolidated in a web application, as documented in the repository."},"d9580705-9f05-407a-a367-1c729da2e63a-results-2":{"text":"Documented client administration flows, including access activation and blocking."},"d9580705-9f05-407a-a367-1c729da2e63a-results-3":{"text":"Transaction and product price histories, with CSV export."},"d9580705-9f05-407a-a367-1c729da2e63a-learnings-1":{"text":"Modeling financial transactions, installments and relationships between business records."},"d9580705-9f05-407a-a367-1c729da2e63a-learnings-2":{"text":"Organizing client access and administrator roles in a Firebase application."},"d9580705-9f05-407a-a367-1c729da2e63a-learnings-3":{"text":"Integrating authentication, persistence and business rules in a React interface."},"d9580705-9f05-407a-a367-1c729da2e63a-link-1":{"label":"Git